{
  "lessonId": "L1M2L5",
  "title": "Lombardy 倫巴底 - 氣泡酒之鄉",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#95a5a6 0%,#bdc3c7 100%)'><h1>🥂 Lombardy 倫巴底</h1><p class='subtitle'>Franciacorta 與米蘭的優雅之地</p></section><section class='slide lombardy-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='lombardy-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='lombardy-map' class='lombardy-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🥂 Lombardy 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(243,156,18,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f39c12'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>Franciacorta與米蘭的優雅之地</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Franciacorta DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>義大利香檳，傳統釀造法</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #e74c3c;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(231,76,60,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e74c3c'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>Oltrepò Pavese MC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>性價比氣泡酒</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(230,126,34,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e67e22'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e67e22'>Valtellina Superiore</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>高山Nebbiolo紅酒</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #3498db;padding-bottom:8px'>💎 B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(52,152,219,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#3498db'>Lugana, Sforzato di Valtellina</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>湖區白酒與風乾紅酒</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📍 產區概況</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>📍</div><div class='card-content'><h3>地理位置</h3><p>義大利北部，鄰近瑞士</p><p>首府：<strong>米蘭 (Milano)</strong></p></div></div><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>🏔️</div><div class='card-content'><h3>地形特色</h3><p>阿爾卑斯山麓</p><p>眾多冰川湖泊（Como, Garda, Iseo）</p></div></div><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>🌾</div><div class='card-content'><h3>葡萄園面積</h3><p>~27,000 公頃</p><p>5 DOCG + 21 DOC</p></div></div><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>🥂</div><div class='card-content'><h3>特色酒款</h3><p>Franciacorta DOCG</p><p>義大利最頂級氣泡酒</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌟 Franciacorta DOCG</h2><div class='franciacorta-showcase'><div class='showcase-header'><h3>🏆 義大利香檳</h3><p>採用傳統香檳法（Metodo Classico）釀造</p></div><div class='showcase-grid'><div class='showcase-detail'><h4>🍇 法定品種</h4><ul><li><strong>Chardonnay</strong> - 主要白葡萄</li><li><strong>Pinot Nero (Pinot Noir)</strong> - 紅葡萄</li><li><strong>Pinot Bianco</strong> - 白葡萄</li></ul></div><div class='showcase-detail'><h4>⏱️ 陳年要求</h4><table class='aging-table'><tr><td><strong>Non-vintage</strong></td><td>18 個月</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Satèn</strong></td><td>24 個月</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Millesimato</strong></td><td>30 個月</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Riserva</strong></td><td>60 個月</td></tr></table></div></div><div class='showcase-styles'><h4>🍾 風格分類</h4><div class='style-cards'><div class='style-card'><div class='style-name'>Franciacorta</div><div class='style-desc'>經典款，白葡萄或混釀</div><div class='style-pressure'>氣壓: 正常</div></div><div class='style-card saten'><div class='style-name'>Satèn</div><div class='style-desc'>僅用白葡萄，口感絲滑</div><div class='style-pressure'>氣壓: 較低（更細緻）</div></div><div class='style-card rose'><div class='style-name'>Rosé</div><div class='style-desc'>加入 Pinot Nero</div><div class='style-pressure'>粉紅色澤</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🆚 Franciacorta vs Champagne</h2><div class='comparison-table-wrapper'><table class='comparison-table'><thead><tr><th class='header-label'>比較項目</th><th class='header-champagne'>🇫🇷 Champagne</th><th class='header-franciacorta'>🇮🇹 Franciacorta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='row-label'>產地</td><td>法國香檳區</td><td>義大利倫巴底</td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>氣候</td><td>大陸性（寒冷）</td><td>溫和（湖泊調節）</td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>土壤</td><td>白堊土</td><td>冰川沉積</td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>釀造法</td><td>傳統香檳法</td><td>傳統香檳法（Metodo Classico）</td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>品種</td><td>Chardonnay, Pinot Noir, Meunier</td><td>Chardonnay, Pinot Nero, Pinot Bianco</td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>風格</td><td>清爽、高酸、礦物感</td><td>果香豐富、柔順、優雅</td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>價格</td><td>$$$-$$$$</td><td>$$-$$$</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 其他重要產區</h2><div class='other-regions'><div class='region-card valtellina'><div class='region-badge'>DOCG</div><h3>Valtellina Superiore</h3><div class='region-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>靠近瑞士的山區</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Nebbiolo（當地稱 Chiavennasca）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>優雅紅酒，高酸度</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>陡峭山坡梯田葡萄園</p><p><strong>子產區：</strong>Grumello, Inferno, Sassella, Valgella</p></div></div><div class='region-card oltrepo'><div class='region-badge'>DOC/DOCG</div><h3>Oltrepò Pavese</h3><div class='region-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>倫巴底南部</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Pinot Nero, Barbera, Croatina</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>紅酒、白酒、氣泡酒皆有</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>產量大，性價比高</p><p><strong>亮點：</strong>Oltrepò Pavese Metodo Classico DOCG</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 配餐建議</h2><div class='pairing-section'><div class='pairing-group'><h4>🥂 Franciacorta</h4><div class='pairing-items'><div class='pairing-item'>🦪 <strong>生蠔</strong> - Satèn 最佳</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍤 <strong>龍蝦</strong> - Millesimato 搭配</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍄 <strong>松露燉飯</strong> - 倫巴底特產</div><div class='pairing-item'>🧀 <strong>Gorgonzola 起司</strong> - 地域性完美搭配</div><div class='pairing-item'>🥗 <strong>開胃菜</strong> - Non-vintage 日常飲用</div></div></div><div class='pairing-group'><h4>🍷 Valtellina Superiore</h4><div class='pairing-items'><div class='pairing-item'>🦌 <strong>野味</strong> - 燉鹿肉</div><div class='pairing-item'>🧀 <strong>Bitto 起司</strong> - 當地陳年起司</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍖 <strong>Pizzoccheri</strong> - 蕎麥麵配培根</div><div class='pairing-item'>🥩 <strong>燉牛肉</strong> - 冬季溫暖料理</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>💡 購買指南</h2><div class='buying-tips'><div class='tip-card beginner'><h4>🌱 入門推薦</h4><ul><li>Franciacorta Non-vintage (€20-30)</li><li>Oltrepò Pavese DOC (€10-15)</li></ul><p class='tip-note'>性價比高，適合日常飲用</p></div><div class='tip-card intermediate'><h4>🍷 進階選擇</h4><ul><li>Franciacorta Satèn (€30-45)</li><li>Franciacorta Millesimato (€35-50)</li><li>Valtellina Superiore Riserva (€25-40)</li></ul><p class='tip-note'>品質優異，適合特殊場合</p></div><div class='tip-card premium'><h4>💎 頂級收藏</h4><ul><li>Franciacorta Riserva (€60-100+)</li><li>Sforzato di Valtellina DOCG (€40-70)</li></ul><p class='tip-note'>陳年潛力佳，值得收藏</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Franciacorta 是義大利最頂級的氣泡酒 DOCG</div><div class='point'>✓ 採用與香檳相同的傳統釀造法（Metodo Classico）</div><div class='point'>✓ Satèn 是 Franciacorta 獨有的風格（低氣壓、絲滑）</div><div class='point'>✓ Valtellina 用 Nebbiolo 釀造優雅的高山紅酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 倫巴底以米蘭為中心，擁有豐富的美食文化</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.intro-card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}.card-icon{font-size:2.5rem}.card-content h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:1.1rem}.card-content p{margin:5px 0;color:#555;line-height:1.6}.card-content strong{color:#34495e;font-size:1.1rem}.franciacorta-showcase{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.showcase-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:3px solid #bdc3c7}.showcase-header h3{margin:0 0 10px;color:#34495e;font-size:1.6rem}.showcase-header p{margin:0;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:1.1rem}.showcase-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin-bottom:25px}.showcase-detail h4{color:#34495e;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.showcase-detail ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.showcase-detail li{color:#555}.aging-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.aging-table td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ecf0f1}.aging-table strong{color:#34495e}.showcase-styles h4{color:#34495e;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.style-cards{display:grid;grid-template